{"id":281572692,"title":"3.Day3","summary":"1.Redux快速上手","content":"<p><strong>1.Redux快速上手</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786971881708-e1e5234d-92a7-4613-a315-d3c9536a3546.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786971966957-3ab71e9a-fbc9-45d9-af0a-fe8d7dbf5af9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786972400174-4429d66f-6b45-4f6f-94a8-233c66c959ee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786972507445-66c15131-26ea-4a09-bbd0-c157632354b2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786972680411-925022b4-7d29-4f84-ab0f-f111fd02cfc8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786972722016-d82154b4-1308-442d-b8a6-dcbc48447c59.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>2。Redux与React--环境准备</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786972954365-3744d178-9d1a-420d-bfea-ef9f4b569801.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786972985691-2ed09399-4f21-4246-a2d7-ec067cd6e9c5.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786973015195-f25ad484-3967-4654-b8d0-bfa9c377c43f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786973042886-3cfbcead-46e0-4550-b23f-323fa4e0b7a5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>然后再启动！</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786973118536-77c718d6-70f5-4433-ab6e-3900e98ea2ff.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>3.Redux与React--实现counter</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786978708955-1d04d4db-c428-4ef4-a231-5a17566e9745.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786978804271-09f3c5a2-5d26-4c45-853e-891c0239729f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p> Redux Toolkit（简称 RTK）   图里用到它的两个核心 API  </p>\n<p><code>**createSlice**</code>（左边文件 counterStore.js） 用来创建一小块状态（slice 切片）：把 <code>state初始数据 + reducers修改函数 + action</code> 一次性写完，自动生成 action，不用手动写<code>type:{xxx}</code>字符串。  </p>\n<p><code>**configureStore**</code>（右边 store/index.js ） 新版创建仓库，替代老的<code>createStore</code>，自动配置中间件、调试工具，把多个 slice 合并成根 store。  </p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787296422099-96b80857-19f6-4327-b313-560c825a1616.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787296448612-a54d03d7-ea12-4d83-ab05-37e7d893c004.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786979140499-a92e4ad3-681e-4c4a-b86c-71a67014b4c7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786979191557-037d74f7-1d58-48b0-ba32-52a6a97dc74c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786979269318-8f8d9355-9b1b-4e61-9491-58a9e1bd16f8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786979395622-d6e8adc6-2b4e-4c7f-bdb0-b4e3a199a5ac.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786979499073-3b000c58-dd66-4e32-8c06-b0bde28aa280.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786979571632-537e1388-2827-4d60-8750-388275216c6e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786979646693-cae5f50c-55a7-4e6a-8717-9d83bdd95b57.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980278126-52b4f4e8-820d-4ed3-ac27-d26271a3b48f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787300844851-e602da2a-1070-4075-bbd2-96826d2b50f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>有效果的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980290679-c5a747ef-4dd6-4f73-b19a-0ff9745866ea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980318012-36cd5c38-5b46-4f7a-a3a9-4d4a7cb3541f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>4.Redux与React--提交acyion传参</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980387724-e36cdc25-adca-487f-9466-7e95c03b723d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980591367-04597bc8-8e2f-40a5-931d-d0fa30ae4b65.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980603548-f0eb4f4f-70b6-41da-90b0-08801eba0489.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>5.Redux与React--异步状态操作</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980708137-3cbbf8b0-601a-482c-8aeb-88b3eec00772.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786980720474-f32bd7c0-abfb-48de-8750-62a2c55b0500.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786981265305-4d2e60e3-fe69-4570-b217-3eefa148fa7f.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787306595373-abf85f8d-16bb-499b-a99f-70cb15e82041.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787306757211-34d3903c-fa55-4d38-8246-2eef60e35b43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786981282558-279901aa-a8dd-4a91-bcd1-c0a1a489b932.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786981322586-ba46f871-50ed-4979-aec1-fea3f69795a1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786981402309-3876028e-254e-42e6-b8d2-27e08ff73412.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786981481868-b6a2e5f1-53d9-40e9-8a06-1d1d070b486d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>6.Redux调试-devtools</strong></p>\n<p>安装扩展工具<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786981569652-a848a44d-538e-420f-a7e5-bbc2dd6a72a6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82407692,"category":{"id":82407692,"name":"React","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-16T16:18:36.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T10:23:46.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/rlg5dd/wpknpz7oyerrcf9l","slug":"wpknpz7oyerrcf9l","wordCount":176}